1
00:00:00,125 --> 00:00:01,793
Why did you even
place that kind of bet?

2
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:03,586
I can't just sit
and look at it.

3
00:00:05,922 --> 00:00:06,631
You think I'd lose?

4
00:00:06,631 --> 00:00:07,465
In middle school, he...

5
00:00:07,465 --> 00:00:08,865
You should just
sit there and watch.

6
00:00:14,973 --> 00:00:16,599
Ten balls, just as I said.

7
00:00:16,766 --> 00:00:19,352
If you fail to throw ten balls
inside my glove alright

8
00:00:19,436 --> 00:00:20,478
then I win.

9
00:00:33,616 --> 00:00:34,720
Dude's flexing so hard.

10
00:00:45,503 --> 00:00:46,503
- One.
- Wait.

11
00:00:47,213 --> 00:00:48,213
Hold it!

12
00:00:56,973 --> 00:00:57,973
Two.

13
00:00:59,517 --> 00:01:00,226
Wait!

14
00:01:00,351 --> 00:01:01,811
Let me get my mask right.

15
00:01:02,645 --> 00:01:03,645
What?

16
00:01:04,397 --> 00:01:06,399
How can a high school kid
throw balls like this?

17
00:01:10,445 --> 00:01:11,613
Give up if it hurts.

18
00:01:13,031 --> 00:01:15,116
I am not getting hurt
by fumbles like that!
